=================
PROMPT 1
=================

Develop an American Checkers minApp. This miniApp will support the human playing
against the computer. Game controls should include:
- New Game You First
- New Game CPU First
- Difficulty, choose between 3 levels.

Use minimax plus alpha-beta.

Do not base this on the TicTacToe or Reversi miniApps. Those games are
different than Checkers so I think a fresh start is best.

Use PORTRAIT orientation.

Put this miniApp in the files/apps/Checkers directory.

